        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00985",
          "explanation": "The doctor used a read-and-repeat structure to reduce confusion.",
          "quote": "家属念一条我复述一条"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The patient’s anxiety and low confidence were repeatedly handled with short, plain, staged instructions and teach-back/checklist methods that improved execution. Although unsafe dose advice occurred elsewhere, the communication adaptation itself was actively performed and had trajectory impact.",
