          "quote": "一旦停药血糖和酮体可能迅速反弹"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01985",
          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced that higher post-meal values should not lead to self-directed extra insulin.",
          "quote": "餐后仍不再补针"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly taught not to self-stop or self-add insulin and addressed hypoglycemia management, but most of this overlaps minimum safety duties and there was not a consistently nuanced correction with patient teach-back of the causal model that symptoms can improve while ketosis/high glucose risk persists.",
