          "quote": "酮症刚控制"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "The trigger was present, but the doctor did not ask targeted questions about prior diagnosis duration, medication gaps, symptoms during gaps, and reasons for stopping, nor integrate a discovered longitudinal pattern into the plan beyond generic adherence warnings.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
