          "explanation": "The doctor gave a near-term endocrine follow-up pathway if appointment access was difficult.",
          "quote": "内分泌门诊让医生当面核对剂量"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02232",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the original inpatient/endocrine team as the reviewing owner.",
          "quote": "原住院团队"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly named endocrinology, ED/ward, nurse station, or original inpatient team as owners, set same-day/next-day routes when unclear, and asked the patient to bring records and medication boxes.",
