          "quote": "右肺上叶磨玻璃结节需定期复查CT"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The right upper-lobe ground-glass nodule follow-up was visible but the doctor did not acknowledge or assign follow-up for it, while the case required separating it from diabetes safety without ignoring it. This is the authored minor chain omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
