          "explanation": "The doctor converted an uncertain reading into a specific insulin dose rather than requiring verification.",
          "quote": "如果纸上10 IU实在看不清"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00227",
          "explanation": "The doctor set a home-management threshold for recent-ketosis hyperglycemia instead of keeping uncertainty within clinician/ED verification.",
          "quote": "只要没有呕吐、腹痛"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor overreached by giving specific insulin dosing and home-triage decisions requiring verified records and clinical assessment. This directly violates the non-overreach/uncertainty-management duty and is serious in a post-ketosis insulin transition.",
